/* The program coerces its own terminal success__ to q1, which does not
   accept it, and the coerced tree is case-analysed, so the coercion's
   assertion fails: unsat.  The reduction's coercion problem marks a checked
   leaf with a terminal it adds and accepts it from every state; when that
   terminal was named success__, the program's success__ was accepted
   there. */
%BEGING
Main x -> F (coerce q1 success__).
F y -> case y of
  a y' => e
| e => e.
%ENDG

%BEGINA
q0 a -> q0.
q0 e -> .
q1 a -> q1.
q1 e -> .
%ENDA

%BEGINT
Main : q0 -> q0.
%ENDT
